        <name>C | Franklinton </name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3APRDMAURWIjv3kdm7WOZB2e4GFqJsL0Vmi-gX_dAYW5E9tMTWKrSJSyHLYZRXxh8ePlVbs2z2uQ0OVhc4zGw-1cmkd92yKcAtzz-VF49OxR-9x_iE0b5F4qkQIYAdsWT7dGxxQUAB6mfciq4mhj_ncwm320_PLtFdlVlZXpW55yirOpcYvGvAgidUQxZJa270r-WDcHGQVg58HK1TGeKC_2MFlZkD41Raph1G5bVNue77Fpl3VdL2Raea2oYaug?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Franklinton is popular with investors because of its predicated appreciation. Historically, it has not been known as a good area. Now, as Columbus grows, developers have been putting a lot of money into the area. It's now starting to become more of a trendy area where young professionals live. <br><br>Statistics and More Info From Niche:<br><br>https://www.niche.com/places-to-live/n/franklinton-columbus-oh/<br><br>Analysis From Homes.com<br><br>https://www.homes.com/columbus-oh/neighborhood/franklinton/]]></description>
