      <name>Cleveland</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>A | 44106 (University Circle, Cleveland Clinic Main Campus)</name>
        <description>This is the zip code that consists of University Circle which is home to Case Western Reserve University, The Cleveland Botanical Gardens, The Cleveland Museum of Art and much more. This is a hot spot for entertainment on the eastern side of Cleveland and is also where the consistently Top 3 ranked hospital system in the world is located; Cleveland Clinic Main Campus. The other attraction not to be mentioned is Little Italy which is a small village full of restaurants, stores, entertainment and more. Investors do very well with short term rentals and Airbnb on the eastern and southern sides of this zip code.</description>
