      <Placemark>
        <name>C | Buckeye-Shaker</name>
        <description>Flanked by the English-inspired Fairhill Road Village Historic District to the north, Buckeye-Shaker is rich in Hungarian roots, while offering diverse shops, bookstores, restaurants, and fast-food eateries along Buckeye Road and surrounding streets. The Shaker Square shopping center is home to a popular, retro-style movie theater that has art deco interiors.</description>
